      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-05-26T11:27:00.000Z",
      "title": "Camlin Fine Sciences Limited Announces Cessation of Santosh Parab as CFO, Effective August 18, 2026",
      "body": "Camlin Fine Sciences Limited at the AGM to be held on August 11, 2026 announced that Mr. Santosh Parab will cease to hold the office of CFO and will be re-designated as President – Strategy and Global CFO, of the Company, effective August 18, 2026. Mr. Santosh Parab is a qualified Chartered Accountant with over two decades of experience in the auditing profession. He previously worked with B.K. Khare & Co, an Indian accounting firm. He has been associated with the Company for nine years, contributing his invaluable knowledge, expertise, and experience to the organization's continued success.",
